{"clock":1,"nonce":"09dd00e82ea8c1cffb3b9ca5d12c44b5","ops":[{"kind":"create","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1792267132,"origin":{"forge":"github.com/guilbep/git-board","event":"issue:5902511561"},"data":{"body":"Draft from the PRD: **[git-board hosted: PRD and plan](https://claude.ai/code/artifact/f2328bbf-e8e6-43a9-81bb-a364a88e1e8d)** (a Claude doc, private until shared from its Share menu).\n\nOne service on the team's Kubernetes serves every repository of an organization as its own board, behind EPFL login, with git as the only store for issues: no issue database.\n\n- One repository = one board, listed from the organization (EPFL-ENAC: 294 repositories).\n- Everything a person creates ends up in git on the forges; the server keeps only caches it can rebuild, so there is nothing to back up.\n- Sync: webhooks bring changes in within seconds, edits go out 30 s after the last one, a sweep every 15 min catches the rest. A GitHub App gets 12,500 requests an hour for the organization.\n- gitlab.epfl.ch runs GitLab 19.4 Community Edition: no group webhooks, so one webhook per project.\n- Login with Entra ID or Keycloak (OIDC); roles per repository from forge permissions and groups.\n\nPhase 1, the pilot (one pod, five repositories):\n\n- [ ] Many repositories in one server: a registry, each repository opened on demand\n- [ ] Fetch only `refs/bugs` and `refs/identities`\n- [ ] `/{org}/{repo}` addresses\n- [ ] OIDC login and roles\n- [ ] GitHub App: webhooks, and short-lived tokens for the fork's sync\n- [ ] Push 30 s after edits, the 15 min sweep, a rate limiter per forge\n- [ ] Helm chart, Prometheus metrics, a first landing page\n\nGate to phase 2: five repositories (co2-calculator among them), ten people, two weeks, no lost edit, sync under 60 s.","title":"Hosted git-board: PRD and plan"}},{"kind":"change-labels","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1792267135,"origin":{"forge":"github.com/guilbep/git-board","event":"issue:5902511561"},"data":{"add":["kind:feat","status:draft"],"remove":null}}]}